# capture.py regenerates everything below from its own deterministic ramps,
# the vips binary and opj_compress, so only capture.py, commands.sh,
# oracle.json and the fixtures a port will embed are pinned.
#
# outputs/ holds the intermediate .v and .raw files, the decoded rasters the
# oracle.json sha256s were taken from, and the probe images for the records
# that need no committed fixture (the suffix sweep, the carrier sweep, the
# colour-space retags, the quality sweep, the subsample matrix).
outputs/
